<section xml:id="sec77-ImproperIntegral" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Improper Integrals</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      In this section, we will discuss the concept of <em>improper integrals</em>. 
    </p>

